Modifications relative to the upstream work (Apache License 2.0 §4(b) notice):
- All `xai-*`/`xai-grok-*` crates renamed into the `alnair-*` namespace; the
  binary is `alnair`, the config directory is `~/.alnair`, and environment
  variables use the `ALNAIR_*` prefix.
- xAI/Grok service integrations removed or replaced: telemetry (Mixpanel,
  OpenTelemetry export, Sentry, trace upload), voice input, announcements,
  plugin marketplace, remote relay/gateway services, and the xAI OAuth and
  subscription-proxy endpoints.
- Re-targeted as a provider-agnostic agent. First-party endpoints default to
  the Kimi Code subscription API (api.kimi.com/coding/v1) and the Moonshot
  open platform (api.moonshot.cn/v1, api.moonshot.ai/v1); on top of those,
  subscription OAuth is wired for Kimi Code, Claude Pro/Max, ChatGPT (Codex),
  GitHub Copilot and xAI Grok, API keys for the open platforms, and
  user-declared providers by base URL. Self-update uses GitHub Releases
  (github.com).

This product includes code ported from openai/codex and sst/opencode; see
crates/codegen/alnair-tools/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the license terms and
the per-file change notices.

This product bundles model metadata derived from models.dev
(https://github.com/sst/models.dev, MIT License) as
crates/codegen/alnair-models/enrichment_snapshot.json, and may refresh it
from https://models.dev/api.json at runtime.
